{"pages":[{"index":0,"markdown":"Bistro Restaurante\n\nBruno Lopez\n\nPhoto - Dec 2024\n\nShare\n\nX\n\n# PIZZAS BISTRO\n\n28 CM\n\n5 FORMAGGI\n\nQueso mozzarella, chihuahua, azul, feta y cabra.\n\n$240\n\nCAPRICCIOSA\n\nJamón serrano, alcachofa, aceituna negra y champiñón.\n\n$262\n\nFLAMENKUCHEN\n\nBase de crema, tocino y cebolla caramelizada.\n\n$240\n\nQUESO AZUL\n\n*Nuestra Especialidad\nBase de crema, queso azul, espinaca, jamón serrano y laminas de manzana verde.\n\n$272\n\n4 STAGIONI\n\nPepperoni, jamón, tocino y chistorra.\n\n$262\n\nITALIANA\n\nPepperoni, cebolla morada, pimiento verde, aceituna negra y campiñones.\n\n$240\n\nHAWAIANA\n\nJamón y piña.\n\n$208\n\nCAPRESE\n\nEspinacas, jamón serrano y tomate deshidratado.\n\n$262\n\n![img-0.jpeg](img-0.jpeg)\n\nALFREDO PORTOBELLO\n\nBase de crema, laminas de portobello y pollo marinado.\n\n$262\n\nMEXICANA\n\nCebolla morada, pimiento verde y chistorra.\n\n$252\n\nVEGETARIANA\n\nEspinaca, calabaza, campiñón, cebolla morada, pimiento verde y aceituna negra.\n\n$230\n\nOSTRICA\n\nOstión ahumado, tocino y mostaza dijón.\n\n$252\n\nMARGARITA\n\nRebanadas de tomate fresco y albahaca deshidratada.\n\n$225\n\nJAMÓN CON CHAMPIÑONES\n\n$205\n\nPEPPERONI\n\n$198\n\n*Agrega a tu pasta o ensalada\n\nPollo: $65\nCamarón: $75\n\n# ENSALADAS\n\nENSALADA GRIEGA\n\nLechuga, pepino, tomate, cebolla morada, aceituna negra, queso feta y vinagreta balsamico.\n\n$185\n\nENSALADA BISTRO\n\n*Al horno\nTomate, campiñones, pimiento verde, cebolla morada, pera, manzana, calabaza, queso brie y chistorra.\n\n$225\n\nENSALADA BALI\n\nEspinaca, mandarina, arándanos, tomate cherry, coco rallado, cacahuate y vinagreta de la casa.\n\n$185\n\nENSALADA DE LA SEMANA\n\nCombinación de lechuga y espinaca, arándanos, tomate cherry, campiñón, calabaza, pera, manzana, almendras y queso de cabra.\n\n$185\n\n# PASTAS\n\nCARBONARA\n\n*Extracto de huevo\nSalsa blanca a base de crema y queso parmesano, con un toque de tocino y nuez moscada.\n\n$235\n\nLINGUINNI PARISIENNE\n\nPimientos, campiñones, jamón en salsa cremosa a base de quesos.\n\n$225\n\nPASTA ESPECIAL\n\nSalsa de tomate de la casa, campiñones, chistorra y queso de cabra.\n\n$235\n\nFRADIAVIOLA\n\nCrema de tomate con un toque de chile de árbol, espinacas y queso feta.\n\n$225\n\nFETUCCINI ALFREDO\n\nSalsa Alfredo a base de queso parmesano\n\n$235\n\nGoogle Maps","images":[{"id":"img-0.jpeg","top_left_x":978,"top_left_y":231,"bottom_right_x":1363,"bottom_right_y":410,"image_base64":null,"image_annotation":null}],"tables":[],"hyperlinks":[],"header":null,"footer":null,"dimensions":{"dpi":200,"height":1844,"width":2384},"confidence_scores":null,"blocks":[{"top_left_x":79,"top_left_y":30,"bottom_right_x":286,"bottom_right_y":57,"content":"Bistro Restaurante","confidence_scores":null,"type":"header"},{"top_left_x":79,"top_left_y":63,"bottom_right_x":255,"bottom_right_y":96,"content":"Bruno Lopez","confidence_scores":null,"type":"header"},{"top_left_x":79,"top_left_y":126,"bottom_right_x":224,"bottom_right_y":150,"content":"Photo - Dec 2024","confidence_scores":null,"type":"header"},{"top_left_x":2136,"top_left_y":17,"bottom_right_x":2258,"bottom_right_y":44,"content":"Share","confidence_scores":null,"type":"header"},{"top_left_x":2312,"top_left_y":17,"bottom_right_x":2336,"bottom_right_y":44,"content":"X","confidence_scores":null,"type":"header"},{"top_left_x":475,"top_left_y":312,"bottom_right_x":721,"bottom_right_y":353,"content":"# PIZZAS BISTRO","confidence_scores":null,"type":"title"},{"top_left_x":566,"top_left_y":353,"bottom_right_x":635,"bottom_right_y":378,"content":"28 CM","confidence_scores":null,"type":"text"},{"top_left_x":320,"top_left_y":412,"bottom_right_x":477,"bottom_right_y":445,"content":"5 FORMAGGI","confidence_scores":null,"type":"text"},{"top_left_x":320,"top_left_y":437,"bottom_right_x":752,"bottom_right_y":504,"content":"Queso mozzarella, chihuahua, azul, feta y cabra.","confidence_scores":null,"type":"text"},{"top_left_x":776,"top_lef